WEBVTT

00:08:29.798 --> 00:08:31.976
And the job of the C is to make the B sad.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.601
And it does, doesn't it?

00:08:33.625 --> 00:08:35.373
(Laughter)

00:08:35.397 --> 00:08:36.608
Composers know that.

00:08:36.632 --> 00:08:39.211
If they want sad music,
they just play those two notes.

00:08:39.235 --> 00:08:42.976
(Music)

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.531
But basically, it's just a B,
with four sads.

00:08:45.555 --> 00:08:47.976
(Laughter)

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.402
Now, it goes down to A.

00:08:50.895 --> 00:08:52.436
Now to G.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:53.686
And then to F.

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:55.769
So we have B, A, G, F.

00:08:56.375 --> 00:08:57.976
And if we have B, A, G, F,

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.587
what do we expect next?

00:08:59.611 --> 00:09:02.721
(Music)